%% One request produces a single distributed trace spanning all four services.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant A as API (Go)
    participant W as Worker (Go)
    participant D as DB adapter (Node)
    participant L as LLM simulator (Python)
    participant C as otelcol-genai

    U->>A: POST /chat { prompt }
    A->>W: POST /process (W3C traceparent)
    par fan-out (concurrent)
        W->>D: POST /query
        D-->>W: rows
    and
        W->>L: POST /generate
        L-->>W: text + tokens
    end
    W-->>A: answer, model, tokens, rows
    A-->>U: 200 { answer, trace_id }

    Note over A,L: every service exports OTLP → collector
    A-->>C: spans / metrics / logs
    D-->>C: spans / metrics / logs
    L-->>C: gen_ai spans (prompt + response, sensitive)
    Note over C: redact prompt/response,<br/>derive token & cost metrics
